{"nodes": [{"id": "code_understanding", "label": "CODE_UNDERSTANDING.md \u2014 Structural Map", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "CODE_UNDERSTANDING.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "code_understanding_local_first_desktop_app", "label": "Local-first Single-user Desktop Application", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CODE_UNDERSTANDING.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The product is a single-user local desktop app for students: the student signs in with their own Google account, data lives on their machine, and there is no HTTP server. 'Backend' means the in-process service/orchestration layer, not a network service."}, {"id": "code_understanding_deterministic_llm_split", "label": "Deterministic Python / LLM Division of Labour", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CODE_UNDERSTANDING.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Deterministic Python does everything it can compute or validate exactly (word counts, required sections, arithmetic, LaTeX escaping, parsing, formatting); the LLM is used only where language understanding is genuinely needed (classification, drafting, rubric judgement). This avoids hallucinated data and unformatted output."}, {"id": "code_understanding_human_approval_gate", "label": "Mandatory Human Approval Gate", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CODE_UNDERSTANDING.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Nothing leaves the machine without a human: export is unreachable until the review node records an approval, and the gate is a structural property of the graph, not a UI convention."}, {"id": "code_understanding_yaml_category_rules", "label": "Data-driven YAML Category Rules", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CODE_UNDERSTANDING.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Academic rules (required sections, word limits, formatting, rubric weights, prompt paths, RAG switches, reference rules) live in YAML so adding a category or tweaking a rubric is a configuration change, not a code change. This is the primary extension point."}, {"id": "code_understanding_langgraph_state_machine", "label": "LangGraph State Machine Orchestration", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CODE_UNDERSTANDING.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The process has loops (evaluate \u2192 regenerate), two pause points (missing information, human review) and must survive a crash. LangGraph gives an explicit resumable state machine instead of free-form agents, and SQLite checkpoints make every step resumable."}, {"id": "code_understanding_six_layer_architecture", "label": "Six-Layer Architecture", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CODE_UNDERSTANDING.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "code_understanding_llmprovider_abstraction", "label": "LLMProvider Abstraction", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CODE_UNDERSTANDING.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "code_understanding_mockprovider", "label": "MockProvider", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CODE_UNDERSTANDING.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "code_understanding_geminiprovider", "label": "GeminiProvider", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CODE_UNDERSTANDING.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "code_understanding_reportcontent", "label": "ReportContent", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CODE_UNDERSTANDING.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "code_understanding_categoryconfig", "label": "CategoryConfig", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CODE_UNDERSTANDING.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "code_understanding_workflowstate", "label": "WorkflowState", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CODE_UNDERSTANDING.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "code_understanding_eleven_step_pipeline", "label": "Eleven-Step Workflow Pipeline", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CODE_UNDERSTANDING.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The spine of the app: normalise \u2192 classify \u2192 load config \u2192 check missing info \u2192 retrieve references \u2192 generate \u2192 evaluate \u2192 regenerate failed \u2192 human review \u2192 export \u2192 persist. Two gates are deliberate: missing information and human approval."}, {"id": "code_understanding_two_pause_points", "label": "Two Interrupt Pause Points", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CODE_UNDERSTANDING.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "There are exactly two LangGraph interrupts (check_missing_info and human_review), one bounded evaluation\u2192regeneration loop, and export is reachable only through the human decision."}, {"id": "code_understanding_sqlite_checkpoint", "label": "SQLite Checkpoint Durability", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CODE_UNDERSTANDING.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "code_understanding_docx_generator", "label": "DocxGenerator", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CODE_UNDERSTANDING.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "code_understanding_pdf_exporter", "label": "PdfExporter", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CODE_UNDERSTANDING.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Best-quality-first fallback chain: Tectonic \u2192 XeLaTeX \u2192 LibreOffice, storing the PDF next to the DOCX. The chain exists so a missing engine degrades gracefully while DOCX remains available."}, {"id": "code_understanding_latex_generator", "label": "LaTeX Generator", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CODE_UNDERSTANDING.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "code_understanding_normalizer", "label": "Input Normalizer and Content Hash", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CODE_UNDERSTANDING.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "code_understanding_classifier", "label": "Assignment Classifier", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CODE_UNDERSTANDING.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "code_understanding_section_generator", "label": "SectionGenerator", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CODE_UNDERSTANDING.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "code_understanding_evaluator", "label": "Evaluator", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CODE_UNDERSTANDING.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Runs deterministic checks (required sections, word limits, banned phrases, citation keys) plus LLM rubric evaluation. It is fail-open: on LLM exception it substitutes a passing score, which can hide real failures."}, {"id": "code_understanding_rag_retriever", "label": "RagRetriever / ChromaDB Retrieval", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CODE_UNDERSTANDING.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Optional grounding in course material: chunk 1000/150 overlap, embed, store in a local ChromaDB collection, retrieve top-k. Disabled by default in all three category configs, so the default path is a no-op."}, {"id": "code_understanding_safe_arithmetic", "label": "Safe AST Arithmetic Evaluator", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CODE_UNDERSTANDING.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "code_understanding_prompt_injection_defense", "label": "Prompt-Injection Defense", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CODE_UNDERSTANDING.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "code_understanding_google_oauth", "label": "Google OAuth Installed-App Flow", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CODE_UNDERSTANDING.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "code_understanding_file_parser_registry", "label": "File Parser Registry", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CODE_UNDERSTANDING.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "code_understanding_ocr_fallback", "label": "OCR Fallback (Currently Broken)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CODE_UNDERSTANDING.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Scanned PDFs have no text layer, so the parser rasterises pages and runs Tesseract. A runtime defect (fitz.Matrix referenced without importing fitz) means the OCR branch silently never produces text."}, {"id": "code_understanding_assignment_repository", "label": "AssignmentRepository", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CODE_UNDERSTANDING.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "code_understanding_main_window", "label": "MainWindow", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CODE_UNDERSTANDING.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "code_understanding_workflow_worker", "label": "WorkflowWorker", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CODE_UNDERSTANDING.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "code_understanding_versioned_outputs", "label": "Versioned Output Folders", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CODE_UNDERSTANDING.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "code_understanding_fabricated_references_risk", "label": "Fabricated Placeholder References (Academic-Integrity Risk)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CODE_UNDERSTANDING.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "When no references are supplied, the generator inserts two fabricated placeholder citations that are rendered as if real. This is an academic-integrity risk even if intended as scaffolding."}, {"id": "code_understanding_preference_injection_gap", "label": "Preference Injection Gap", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CODE_UNDERSTANDING.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Student profile and document preferences are persisted but never injected into generation, so the front page falls back to 'Student' and hardcoded institution defaults."}, {"id": "code_understanding_composition_root_spread", "label": "Split Composition Root", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CODE_UNDERSTANDING.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "There is no DI container; dependencies are passed explicitly, but the composition root is split across app/main.py, app/ui/workers.py and workflow/graph.py rather than centralized."}, {"id": "code_understanding_graphify_tool", "label": "Graphify Knowledge Graph Tool", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CODE_UNDERSTANDING.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "code_understanding", "target": "code_understanding_local_first_desktop_app", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CODE_UNDERSTANDING.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "code_understanding", "target": "code_understanding_deterministic_llm_split", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CODE_UNDERSTANDING.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "code_understanding", "target": "code_understanding_human_approval_gate", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CODE_UNDERSTANDING.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "code_understanding", "target": "code_understanding_yaml_category_rules", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CODE_UNDERSTANDING.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "code_understanding", "target": "code_understanding_langgraph_state_machine", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CODE_UNDERSTANDING.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "code_understanding", "target": "code_understanding_six_la